            "review_title": "Review at Sushiya Kiku",
            "review_text": "Zendy\nBrighton and Hove, United Kingdom79 contributions\n0\nYummy in my tummy\nSep 2019\nI was recommended by a friend to check out this Japanese restaurant, so we decided to go there for lunch. Afterwards, it becomes our favorite Japanese restaurant in town :) \n\nMany choices for lunch set and a great selection of sashimi and sushi rolls. Food was really fresh and delicious. Staffs were very welcoming and friendly. \n\nIt's a bit pricey but you pay for what you eat so it's really worth it ;)\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten October 18, 2019",
